OL,3,GNEWSAPM defends Gogglebox appearance
OL,4,Aafter Badenoch criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fdefended his decision to appear on a
OL,8,Fcelebrity episode of Channel 4 hit show
OL,9,FGogglebox after opposition leader Kemi
OL,10,FBadenoch said she was "amazed" he had
OL,11,Ftime to do it.
OL,13,FBadenoch told BBC Breakfast that "even
OL,14,Fas a junior minister or as a secretary
OL,15,Fof state, I never had time to go on
OL,16,FGogglebox" and it "takes hours to do".
OL,18,FThe Conservative leader was responding
OL,19,Fafter Burnham was revealed in the
OL,20,Fline-up of a celebrity episode of the
OL,21,Fshow in aid of Stand Up To Cancer -
OL,22,Fwhich will air later.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
